*.pdf.tmp
# vale packages, fetched with `vale sync`
styles/
.vale-cache/
# The works themselves stay out of the repo -- most are in copyright, and the
# rest are large. The *records* of what was verified against them are the
# book's citation audit trail and must be tracked, so the convention is: a
# record is .md, a work never is. See sources/README.md; what was checked goes
# in sources/VERIFIED.md and docs/<livro>/references.md.
sources/*
!sources/*.md
